WEBVTT

00:04:58.053 --> 00:05:00.984
mending, bending and amending,

00:05:00.984 --> 00:05:04.291
my ideal bow began to take shape,

00:05:04.291 --> 00:05:08.146
and when it was finally done,

00:05:08.146 --> 00:05:11.600
it looked like this.

00:05:12.673 --> 00:05:14.910
I was so proud of myself

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:20.984
for inventing a perfect bow on my own.

00:05:20.984 --> 00:05:24.416
This is a picture of Korean traditional bows

00:05:24.416 --> 00:05:26.312
taken from a museum,

00:05:26.312 --> 00:05:31.796
and see how my bow resembles them.